# NebulaForge

🚀 NebulaForge is a lightweight developer toolkit that simplifies GitHub repository creation and project initialization.

## Features

- Automatic repository scaffolding
- Clean project structure generation
- Git initialization
- README generation
- License templates
- GitHub Actions workflow templates
- Cross-platform support
- Fast and customizable

## Installation


```bash
python main.py
```

## Project Structure

```
NebulaForge/
│
├── src/
├── templates/
├── assets/
├── docs/
├── tests/
├── main.py
├── requirements.txt
└── README.md
```

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/NebulaForge.git
cd NebulaForge
```

